   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&45=\\frac{n}{2}\\left[36-3(n-1)\\right]\\\\[5pt]&90=n(39-3n)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ n^2-13n+30=0\\end{aligned}\\]",
